Package: harbour-quizduel
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armel
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Depends: libqtcore4, libqtgui4, libqt4-network, libqt4-declarative, qt-components
Section: user/games
Priority: optional
Description: QuizDuel client (independent re-implementation)
 Login and registration client for the MAG QuizDuel backend, MeeGo Harmattan
 edition (Qt 4.7 with com.nokia.meego). HTTPS and the davinci protocol run in a
 static rustls helper, because Harmattan's OpenSSL 0.9.8 cannot reach the server.
 The classic duel follows once the game protocol is rebuilt.
Maemo-Display-Name: QuizDuel
XB-Maemo-Icon-26:
@ICON@
